!Name: p6mod9dup
!C A c/3 forward glider duplicator for periods which are 6 (mod 9).
!C This uses a period 9 spaceship whose phase is changed by a forward
!C glider impact.  The two output gliders travel in opposite sideways
!C directions.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
